<title>UK: St Petersburg prices $300 mln five-year Eurobond.</title>
<headline>St Petersburg prices $300 mln five-year Eurobond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond has been priced, lead manager Salomon Brothers said on Thursday.</p>
<p> BORROWER   CITY OF ST PETERSBURG</p>
<p> AMT	  $300 MLN  COUPON     9.50	MATURITY    18.JUN.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  99.536    PAY DATE    18.JUN.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.00	REOFFER    99.536    SPREAD	+312.5 BP</p>
<p> IBCA	 BB+	 LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    SEMI-ANN</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  BB-	 DENOMS (K) 10	  SALE LIMITS GB/RU/US</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   IPMA 2</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  RUSSIA    TAX PROVS   =</p>
